<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of Aug 13.</p>
<p>				     Aug 13/Aug 12    Aug 13/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.06		 9.08</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 7.24</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.17		14.92</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.51		59.17</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.19		42.53</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.20		43.24</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.10		19.69</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.04		36.23</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.25		53.66</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.23		52.11</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		35.99</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.55	     110.55</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,843,986,084,801</p>
