<p>  Money market funds			  3,448,700,924,227</p>
<p>  International funds			   106,908,181,646</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    258,302,626,063</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
